unselor Education from August 2026-August 2027. This individual will serve as a member of the core faculty in the CACREP -accredited Counselor Education terminal master’s program. The successful candidate will teach masters-level courses, supervise practicum and internship and be involved in practicum and internship placement. This faculty member will also be actively involved in CACREP -related and other departmental and university-wide administrative duties and committees. Preference will be given to candidates with experience in CMHC -specific leadership or experiences that relate to such leadership and administrative opportunities. The anticipated starting date is August 2026; however, the search will remain open until the position is filled. Salary will be based on qualifications and experience. Required Qualifications: Candidates must hold a doctorate in Counselor Education from a CACREP accredited program and be licensed or licensed-eligible in the state of New Jersey. ABD is not acceptable. We seek candidates with a strong track record of teaching and service in counseling. The area of program emphasis is open but training in Clinical Mental Health Counseling is highly desired with comparable counseling, teaching, and clinical experience. The candidate must be able to teach core courses at the Masters level in Clinical Mental Health Counseling as well as engage in service to our CMHC program. The individual must be committed to high-quality instruction and be able to mentor students. Employment is contingent upon a satisfactory background check. Candidates for hire will be required to sign a waiver authorizing the background check and produce a Social Security Card. Preferred Qualifications: Hours Worked Posting Date: 06/29/2026 Special Instructions to Applicants: Application Types Accepted: Faculty Profile Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Required Documents Required Documents Cover Letter Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents Teaching Philosophy Letter of Reference 1 Letter of Reference 2 Letter of Reference 3 Other Document Research Statement Footer goes here To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
